{"name":"Serene","hex":"#dce3e4","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Serene","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from English. A rare variant of Serena."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Serene"}],"entries":[{"title":"Serene (phone)","blocks":[{"text":"Serene is a mobile phone produced as a joint venture between Samsung Electronics and Bang & Olufsen. It was released in the last quarter of 2005 in Europe. It was available in select stores throughout the world and cost $1275 (~€1000)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/87/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg/330px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serene_(phone)"},{"title":"Serene (yacht)","blocks":[{"text":"Serene is one of the world's largest private superyachts. It was built by Italian shipyard Fincantieri with interior design by Reymond Langton Design. Now owned by Mohammed bin Salman, the Crown Prince of Saudi Arabia, the Serene was delivered to her original owner, Yuri Shefler, in August 2011. At delivery, she was one of the 10 largest yachts in the world with an overall length of 133.9 m and a beam of 18.5 m."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Serene_2.jpg/330px-Serene_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serene_(yacht)"},{"title":"Serene (pianist)","blocks":[{"text":"Serene is an American concert pianist and computer scientist. She is the inventor of Snowflake, the anti-censorship software package used by The Tor Project. Serene is a touring classical musician. Her experimental performances combine high technology with pianism, such as performing piano while accompanied by musical robots."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Serene_pianist_postconcert_palermo_2026.jpg/330px-Serene_pianist_postconcert_palermo_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serene_(pianist)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/87/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg/500px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/87/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg/1280px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/87/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg/500px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASamsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Open.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b4/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg/500px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b4/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg/1280px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b4/Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg/500px-Samsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Serene, closed, on stand.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASamsung_Serene_Cell_Phone%2C_Closed.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Serene_2.jpg/500px-Serene_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Serene_2.jpg/1280px-Serene_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campai